Aerial Fiber Optic

Aerial Fiber Optic Services

Lunder Corp provides fiber optic installation in aerial and underground environments. Our team of highly qualified technicians are proficient in the installation and maintenance of underground and aerial optical fiber cables.

Fiber Optic Services
INSTALLATION
Our installation service comprises deploying, running, pulling, blowing, and connecting cables underground or in an aerial environment. Every installation method is safe, clean, and done by trained and certified technicians.
SPLICE
Our technician provides proven splicing solutions for the continuity of fiber optic networks. All technicians are trained in best practices and proper handling of fiber, as well as proper documentation of the splice.
TESTING
Our technicians' use of OTDR to test optical attenuation, reflectance, and end-to-end fiber loss. The OTDR is sent to the fiber with a laser pulse and the reflected signal is measured, displayed, and analyzed.
LOCATE
Using a complete set of cable locators and specialized training, our technicians can accurately locate buried cable.
