About Us

Lunder Corp is a small company founded by Luiz Nobre, a certified technician with over 20 years of experience in the industry. Lunder Corp is comprised of a team of highly qualified technicians that specialize in the installation and maintenance of underground and aerial optical fiber cables.

We have a strong commitment to safety and quality as well as the technical expertise to deliver complex projects. We offer our services to internet service providers, municipalities, and utilities.

